"90s tooth rescue (+{0} F⁻ if you win, and you can’t lose the tooth!)":"90s 护牙救援（赢了得 +{0} F⁻，而且牙齿绝不会掉！）",
"A brush reaches 3 of a tooth’s 5 sides. About a third of each tooth hides in the tight gaps until you floss.":"牙刷只能刷到牙齿 5 个面中的 3 个。每颗牙大约有三分之一藏在窄缝里，要用牙线才能清干净。",
"A buffer from your spit cancels germ acid. Then minerals and fluoride can rebuild the enamel.":"唾液里的缓冲物质能中和细菌酸液，接着矿物质和氟就能修复牙釉质。",
"A little thinner than the front tooth, with one rounded corner and a small dent on the back.":"比中间的门牙稍微薄一点，有一个圆角，背面还有个小凹窝。",
"A little wider than the lower front tooth, with 1 root. It helps the front teeth cut food.":"比下排中间的门牙稍微宽一点，有 1 条牙根，帮门牙一起切碎食物。",
"A rounded tooth with 1 root. It often has 3 points and is great at crushing tough food.":"圆润的牙齿，有 1 条牙根。它通常有 3 个牙尖，特别擅长压碎难嚼的食物。",
"A sharp point with a long, strong root. It works with the upper canine to protect the back teeth.":"有一个尖头和又长又壮的牙根。它和上排尖牙配合，一起保护后牙。",
"A small tooth with a big outer point, a small inner point and 1 root.":"一颗小牙齿，外侧有个大牙尖，内侧有个小牙尖，还有 1 条牙根。",
"A soft space with nerves and blood vessels. It feeds the tooth and feels hot, cold and pressure. Healthy pulp keeps a tooth alive.":"牙齿中间柔软的空间，里面有神经和血管。它给牙齿输送营养，还能感觉冷、热和压力。健康的牙髓能让牙齿一直活着。",
"A thin layer covers the root. Thousands of tiny fibers hold the tooth in its socket like a hammock. They cushion every bite.":"一层薄衣包着牙根。成千上万根细纤维像吊床一样把牙齿稳稳拉在牙槽里，缓冲每一次咀嚼。",
"A wide grinding tooth with 4 points (sometimes a tiny 5th one!) and 3 roots.":"宽大的研磨牙，有 4 个牙尖（有时还会长出小小的第 5 个！）和 3 条牙根。",
