"Hard scrubbing hurts gums and still misses the gaps between teeth. Gentle tilted brushing plus C-shape flossing protects both teeth and gums.":"用力猛刷会伤到牙龈，还会漏掉牙缝。轻柔倾斜刷牙加上 C 形牙线清洁，能同时保护牙齿和牙龈。",
